The repository and the setup ZIP include no Fiji or model binaries.
The Windows installer (Cytellect-Setup-<version>.exe) bundles unmodified official
distributions of Fiji (GPL-3.0, with its JDK and plugins, including the StarDist
model), Python and the locked
Python packages; licenses/THIRD_PARTY_BUNDLED.txt in the installation lists each
component's license. The corresponding source of the bundled components whose
license requires it (GPL, LGPL and similar), for exactly the bundled version, is
attached to the same release as Cytellect-<version>-gpl-sources.zip. For the
components listed in engines/fiji/source-exceptions.json, whose source could not be
fetched or whose license could not be determined, only the upstream source location
is given (owner decision of 2026-10-30; see docs/oss.md).
